{"content":[{"c":["SINGER"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["The professional singer was important in temple worship. David first organized singers for worship in the tabernacle (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.33","r":"1Chr.9.33","rawR":"1Chr.9.33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.33","value":"1Chr.9.33"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:33"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.15.16,19,27","r":"1Chr.15.16,19,27","rawR":"1Chr.15.16,19,27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.15.16,19,27","value":"1Chr.15.16,19,27"}],"t":"ref","v":"15:16, 19, 27"},"). Later, they ministered in Solomon’s temple (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.5.12-13","r":"2Chr.5.12-13","rawR":"2Chr.5.12-13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.5.12-13","value":"2Chr.5.12-13"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 5:12-13"},") and for other kings (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.20.21","r":"2Chr.20.21","rawR":"2Chr.20.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.20.21","value":"2Chr.20.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"20:21"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.23.13","r":"2Chr.23.13","rawR":"2Chr.23.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.23.13","value":"2Chr.23.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"23:13"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.35.15","r":"2Chr.35.15","rawR":"2Chr.35.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.35.15","value":"2Chr.35.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"35:15"},"). After the exile, the singers were again active (",{"href":"?bref=Ezra.2.41,70","r":"Ezra.2.41,70","rawR":"Ezra.2.41,70","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ezra.2.41,70","value":"Ezra.2.41,70"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ezr 2:41, 70"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.7.1,44,73","r":"Neh.7.1,44,73","rawR":"Neh.7.1,44,73","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.7.1,44,73","value":"Neh.7.1,44,73"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 7:1, 44, 73"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.10.28,39","r":"Neh.10.28,39","rawR":"Neh.10.28,39","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.10.28,39","value":"Neh.10.28,39"}],"t":"ref","v":"10:28, 39"},"). They sang psalms for temple worship (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.68.25","r":"Ps.68.25","rawR":"Ps.68.25","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.68.25","value":"Ps.68.25"}],"t":"ref","v":"Pss 68:25"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Ps.87.7","r":"Ps.87.7","rawR":"Ps.87.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.87.7","value":"Ps.87.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"87:7"},"). Some were appointed “chief singers” (",{"href":"?bref=Hab.3.19","r":"Hab.3.19","rawR":"Hab.3.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Hab.3.19","value":"Hab.3.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"Hb 3:19"},"). The sons of Asaph were prominent among them."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Music_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Music_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Music_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Music"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Singer","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 9:33","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.9.33","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.9.33","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.9.33"},{"anchorText":"15:16, 19, 27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.15.16,19,27","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.15.16,19,27","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.15.16,19,27"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 5:12-13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.5.12-13","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.5.12-13","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.5.12-13"},{"anchorText":"20:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.20.21","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.20.21","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.20.21"},{"anchorText":"23:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.23.13","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.23.13","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.23.13"},{"anchorText":"35:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.35.15","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.35.15","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.35.15"},{"anchorText":"Ezr 2:41, 70","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ezra.2.41,70","rawQueryValue":"Ezra.2.41,70","sourceRefExact":"Ezra.2.41,70"},{"anchorText":"Neh 7:1, 44, 73","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.7.1,44,73","rawQueryValue":"Neh.7.1,44,73","sourceRefExact":"Neh.7.1,44,73"},{"anchorText":"10:28, 39","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.10.28,39","rawQueryValue":"Neh.10.28,39","sourceRefExact":"Neh.10.28,39"},{"anchorText":"Pss 68:25","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.68.25","rawQueryValue":"Ps.68.25","sourceRefExact":"Ps.68.25"},{"anchorText":"87:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.87.7","rawQueryValue":"Ps.87.7","sourceRefExact":"Ps.87.7"},{"anchorText":"Hb 3:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Hab.3.19","rawQueryValue":"Hab.3.19","sourceRefExact":"Hab.3.19"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"2840da3f9f43bdc3172659866afe3d5c1624231bf385689f5af98bdbbae1fcf7","sourceItemName":"Singer","sourceItemOrder":443,"sourceMember":"Articles/S.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Singer","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Singer","title":"Singer","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}